SACRILEGE.

ECHO-1 HAS BEEN ISSUED A COURSE HEADING OF 166ø SOUTH BY SOUTH
EAST. THIS WILL TAKE THE PLT THROUGH SYRIAN DUG IN POSITIONS.
1ST PLTS PRIMARY OBJECTIVE IS THE SANITIZING OF THIS REGION, 
DESIGNATED ROMEO DELTA-3. 

MLF COMSAC INTEL HAS ISSUED THE ADVISORY WARNING THAT THE 
HEAVIEST CONCENTRATION OF SYRIAN FORCES WILL BE IN THE PASS 
DESIGNATED SIERRA-4.

ECHO-2 MUST ASSUME A COURSE HEADING OF 223ø EAST AND SOUTH INTO
SYRIAN OCCUPIED TERRITORY. ECHO-2'S PRIMARY OBJECTIVE WILL BE THE
REMAINING SYRIAN ARTILLERY PLATFORM. 

1ST AND 2ND PLT ARE THEN ORDERED TO SECONDARY TARGET IN SOUTH/
EAST AREA OF OPERATION: SYRIAN LOGISTICS DEPOT. BOTH PLTS ARE 
ORDERED TO NEUTRALIZE ALL ELEMENTS WITHIN THIS ENCAMPMENT.
